X-WR-CALNAME:Weaver line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-18T21:45:00&endDate=2026-08-19T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Monday 17\, Tuesday 18\, Wednesday 19 and Thursday 20 August\, after 2245\, no service between Hackney Downs and Chingford. Last trains are at 2231 from Liverpool Street to Chingford and at 2253 from Chingford to Liverpool Street. Replacement bus service L3 operates between Hackney Downs and Chingford via Clapton\, St James Street\, Walthamstow Central\, Wood Street and Highams Park. The last three northbound buses start from Liverpool Street at 0014 0044 and 0114 and also serve Bethnal Green\, Cambridge Heath and London Fields (Mare Street).
DTEND:20260819T002900Z
DTSTART:20260818T214500Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Part Closure
UID:0801f49a-02d8-43a9-9e19-7c45818d81f1@0801.org
END:VEVENT
